<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2164289660"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1798404130"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="トレモロアイズ"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Poppin'Party"/><amll:meta key="album" value="TARINAI/トレモロアイズ"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:01.464"><div begin="00:23.830" end="03:52.806"><p begin="00:23.830" end="00:25.871" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">聞きたいこと聞けず<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">未能问出心中的疑问</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ki ta i ko to ki ke zu</span></p><p begin="00:26.436" end="00:30.213" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">ずっと胸の奥 溜まり続けた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">任由其不断地堆积在心里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to mu ne no o ku ta ma ri tsu du ke ta</span></p><p begin="00:31.820" end="00:34.180" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">みんな不安じゃないの?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难道大家不会不安吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi n na fu a n ja na i no ？</span></p><p begin="00:34.464" end="00:35.511" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">未来は――<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不能任由未来顺其自然吧？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi ra i ha ko no ma ma ja da me na no ？</span></p><p begin="00:35.545" end="00:37.419" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">このままじゃだめなの?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样的下去不好吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi ra i ha ko no ma ma ja da me na no ？</span></p><p begin="00:38.063" end="00:41.766" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">急に涙 止まらなくなってた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">泪水在突然间滑落不止</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kyu u ni na mi da to ma ra na ku na 't te ta</span></p><p begin="00:43.775" end="00:47.024" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">変わりたくないのは わたしだけ?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不愿意做出改变的就只有我吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka wa ri ta ku na i no ha wa ta shi da ke ？</span></p><p begin="00:47.024" end="00:49.064" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">(Tremolo Eyes)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">（止不住颤抖的双眼）</span></p><p begin="00:49.504" end="00:52.858" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">新しい自分が手招きしている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">焕然一新的我在不断地挥手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ta ra shi i ji bu n ga te ma ne ki shi te i ru</span></p><p begin="00:52.858" end="00:54.778" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">(Flowers Bloom)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">（宛如正在盛开的鲜花）</span></p><p begin="00:55.389" end="00:58.082" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">あとはほんの少し勇気出せば<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">之后只需要鼓起些许的勇气</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a to ha ho n no su ko shi yu u ki da se ba</span></p><p begin="00:58.149" end="01:00.607" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">いつかあの空に届く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终能企及那片天空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka a no so ra ni to do ku</span></p><p begin="01:01.090" end="01:06.091" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">震える瞳 真っ直ぐ見つめて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">颤抖的双眸 坚定地直视前方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ru e ru hi to mi ma 's su gu mi tsu me te</span></p><p begin="01:06.999" end="01:09.173" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">それぞれの夢はきっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们各自怀揣的那个梦想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re zo re no yu me ha ki 't to</span></p><p begin="01:09.810" end="01:11.984" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">それぞれの道繋ぐよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">定能连接起各自的道路</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re zo re no mi chi tsu na gu yo</span></p><p begin="01:12.744" end="01:17.732" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">ためらうことも 突き進むことも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">彷徨犹豫也好 勇往直前也罢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta me ra u ko to mo tsu ki su su mu ko to mo</span></p><p begin="01:18.606" end="01:20.881" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">五人選んだ未来を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那份坚信不疑的牵绊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">go ji n e ra n da mi ra i wo</span></p><p begin="01:21.373" end="01:25.310" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">信じてた絆が照らすから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终将会照亮五人选择的未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi n ji te ta ki zu na ga te ra su ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:36.659" end="01:38.516" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">みんなと違う場所<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾经有过与大家截然不同的经历</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi n na to chi ga u ba sho mi te ta ko to</span></p><p begin="01:39.216" end="01:42.844" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">見てたこと ずっと後ろめたかった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为看到了它 便一直对此心怀愧疚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to u shi ro me ta ka 't ta</span></p><p begin="01:44.595" end="01:46.838" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">だけど今は言えるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是此刻我可以断言</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ke do i ma ha i e ru yo</span></p><p begin="01:47.231" end="01:48.167" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">未来の――<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算未来的景色有所改变</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi ra i no ke shi ki ga ka wa 't te mo</span></p><p begin="01:48.251" end="01:50.108" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">景色が変わっても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕景色发生变化</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi ra i no ke shi ki ga ka wa 't te mo</span></p><p begin="01:50.732" end="01:54.597" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">わたしたちは わたしたちなんだし<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们也依然是我们自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi ta chi ha wa ta shi ta chi na n da shi</span></p><p begin="01:56.464" end="01:59.749" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">かけがえない日々が蘇る<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">弥足珍贵的时光就此苏醒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ke ga e na i hi bi ga yo mi ga e ru</span></p><p begin="01:59.749" end="02:01.822" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">(Tremolo Eyes)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">（止不住颤抖的双眼）</span></p><p begin="02:02.191" end="02:05.555" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">新しい旅を恐れなくていい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对全新的旅程不必再有畏惧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ta ra shi i ta bi wo o so re na ku te i i</span></p><p begin="02:05.555" end="02:07.597" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">(Flowers Bloom)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">（宛如正在盛开的鲜花）</span></p><p begin="02:08.055" end="02:10.147" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">出来たって 出来なくたって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论最后能不能做到</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de ki ta 't te de ki na ku ta 't te</span></p><p begin="02:10.501" end="02:13.195" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">やりたいことをやって生きよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">余生都想尝试想做的事情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya ri ta i ko to wo ya 't te i ki yo u</span></p><p begin="02:13.916" end="02:18.850" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">戸惑う瞳 ちょっぴり怖いな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">困惑的眼眸 流露着些许恐惧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ma do u hi to mi cho 'p pi ri ko wa i na</span></p><p begin="02:19.723" end="02:21.964" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">それぞれの鍵を探し<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们在找寻各自的钥匙</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re zo re no ka gi wo sa ga shi</span></p><p begin="02:22.535" end="02:24.844" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">それぞれの扉開ける<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">开启属于各自的那扇门</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re zo re no to bi ra a ke ru</span></p><p begin="02:25.436" end="02:30.534" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">ゆっくりでいい 今すぐでもいい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">缓步前行也好 立马行动也罢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu 'k ku ri de i i i ma su gu de mo i i</span></p><p begin="02:31.369" end="02:33.560" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">キミが向かった未来を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你怀揣梦想的那份冲动</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ga mu ka 't ta mi ra i wo</span></p><p begin="02:34.153" end="02:37.917" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">夢みてた鼓動が守るから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将守护你心中理想的未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu me mi te ta ko do u ga ma mo ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:39.550" end="02:42.060" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">日が落ちて夜を越え<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夕阳西下熬过黑夜 迎来晨曦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ga o chi te yo ru wo ko e a sa to na ri</span></p><p begin="02:42.465" end="02:48.178" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">朝となり 次の季節が来る<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">朝阳升起 下一个季节终会来临</span></p><p begin="02:49.114" end="02:52.095" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">ねえ見つめようよ 愛や夢を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 一同去寻获吧 将爱与梦想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne e mi tsu me yo u yo a i ya yu me wo</span></p><p begin="02:52.508" end="02:56.345" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">理想や祈りや自由を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">理想与祈祷还有自由</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ri so u ya i no ri ya ji yu u wo</span></p><p begin="02:57.484" end="03:03.131" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">全部叶えよう いつもキミと一緒に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">统统都付诸现实 我会一直与你相伴</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ze n bu ka na e yo u i tsu mo ki mi to i 's sho ni</span></p><p begin="03:04.828" end="03:09.657" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">震える瞳 真っ直ぐ見つめて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">颤抖的双眸 坚定地直视前方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ru e ru hi to mi ma 's su gu mi tsu me te</span></p><p begin="03:10.635" end="03:12.776" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">それぞれの夢はきっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们各自怀揣的那个梦想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re zo re no yu me ha ki 't to</span></p><p begin="03:13.480" end="03:15.638" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">それぞれの道繋ぐよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">定能连接起各自的道路</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re zo re no mi chi tsu na gu yo</span></p><p begin="03:16.347" end="03:21.254" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">ためらうことも 突き進むことも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">彷徨犹豫也好 勇往直前也罢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta me ra u ko to mo tsu ki su su mu ko to mo</span></p><p begin="03:22.221" end="03:24.463" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">五人選んだ未来を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那份坚信不疑的牵绊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">go ji n e ra n da mi ra i wo</span></p><p begin="03:25.080" end="03:28.963" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">信じてた絆が照らすから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终将会照亮五人选择的未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi n ji te ta ki zu na ga te ra su ka ra</span></p><p begin="03:31.589" end="03:34.528" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">震える瞳 見つめて――<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">颤抖的双眸 直视前方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ru e ru hi to mi mi tsu me te</span></p><p begin="03:40.265" end="03:42.088" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">聞きたいこと聞けず<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">未能问出心中的疑问</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ki ta i ko to ki ke zu</span></p><p begin="03:42.780" end="03:46.496" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">ずっと胸の奥 溜まり続けた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">任由其不断地堆积在心里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to mu ne no o ku ta ma ri tsu du ke ta</span></p><p begin="03:48.208" end="03:50.566" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">だけど今は言えるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但现在我就可以断言</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ke do i ma ha i e ru yo</span></p><p begin="03:50.866" end="03:52.806" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">瞳 見つめて――<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">双眸 直视前方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to mi mi tsu me te</span></p></div></body></tt>